Source OpenCC version ver.1.4.2
https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC/tree/025f371dc76b598d77384fbdab90c937471844d8/data/dictionary

Fish Voice ships a modified subset of TSCharacters.txt, TSPhrases.txt, and
STPhrases.txt. The generator keeps preferred results, skips ambiguous standalone
characters where the original form is also a candidate, and reverse-matches
known phrases corroborated by the preferred single-character mappings. This
dictionary omits regional vocabulary, inferred rare shapes, and compatibility
ideograph normalization.

To rebuild, save the three upstream source files with their original names in
one directory. The generator verifies their pinned SHA-256 digests.

    python scripts/build_asr_hans_dictionary.py <directory> helper/asr_zh_dictionary.txt.gz

